Variants are identified and annotated using the GRCh38 as the reference human genome sequence
Allele 1, Effect Allele
Allele 2, non-effect allele
ALT, alternative allele in 1000 Genome reference
REF, reference allele in 1000 Genome reference
MAF.EUR, minor allele frequency in 1000 Genome reference of European 

GWAS meta-analysis summary statistics were seperated by chromosomes (*: 1 - 22)
meta-analysis of Europeans: 
EUR_CD_chr*.txt.gz
EUR_UC_chr*.txt.gz
EUR_IBD_chr*.txt.gz

meta-analysis of Europeans and East Asians: 
EASEUR_CD_chr*.txt.gz
EASEUR_UC_chr*.txt.gz
EASEUR_IBD_chr*.txt.gz
